//  independently written Pine Script code. It is not a copied, decompiled,
//  reverse-engineered, or republished version of any third-party indicator.
//  All calculations, structures, variables, functions, visualization
//  components, and internal logic have been implemented independently.
//
//  Development Verification:
//  The indicator follows professional software engineering practices with
//  modular architecture, optimized execution, clean code organization,
//  adaptive calculations, and non-repainting signal generation suitable for
//  live market conditions across multiple asset classes and timeframes.
